---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Nehal Joshi"
  description="About Nehal Joshi — education, technology, and human-centered design."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="mb-6">About</h1>

    <div class="prose max-w-none">
      <p class="text-xl mb-8">
        I'm Nehal Joshi, an innovative education program leader with a passion for transforming how people learn,
        connect, and grow. My work sits at the intersection of education, technology, and human-centered design.
      </p>

      <div class="w-full h-auto mb-10 overflow-hidden">
        <img
          src="/nehal-talking.jpeg"
          alt="Nehal Joshi speaking at an event"
          class="w-full object-cover rounded-md"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-4">Background</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          Across my 15+ year journey in education and design, I've focused on creating impactful learning experiences
          that bridge theoretical knowledge with real-world application. My interdisciplinary approach combines
          cognitive science, experiential learning methodologies, and human-centered design to develop solutions that
          resonate with diverse audiences.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          My expertise spans curriculum architecture, learning experience design, and data-driven product vision.
          Today, I am building a technlogoy learning platform for young learners that emphasises learning with first
          principles thinking.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 bg-gray-200" />

      <div class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-4">Philosophy</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          My approach to education and design is built on the belief that learning should be transformative,
          accessible, and deeply connected to real-world contexts. My work is guided by these principles:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4 space-y-2">
          <li>Human-centered approaches that prioritize empathy and diverse learner needs</li>
          <li>Thoughtful integration of technology that enhances rather than replaces meaningful human interaction</li>
          <li>Data-driven design with continuous improvement through research and feedback</li>
          <li>Equitable access to quality learning experiences regardless of background or circumstance</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 bg-gray-200" />

      <div class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-6">Experience</h2>
        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-2 md:gap-8">
            <div class="md:col-span-1">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Founder & Chief Educator</h3>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground">Lernok</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">2025 - Present</p>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-2">
              <ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-2">
                <li>Building Lernok - A first principles tech learning platform for ages 10-16</li>
                <li>
                  A next-gen program that builds foundational skills in AI, coding, design, data science, and
                  entrepreneurship
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-2 md:gap-8">
            <div class="md:col-span-1">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Independent Consultant</h3>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground">Various Organizations</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">2023 - Present</p>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-2">
              <ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-2">
                <li>Advising on curriculum development and program design to an EdTech startup</li>
                <li>Directed product and growth strategy for a D2C startup</li>
                <li>Conducting in-depth analysis of marketing and sales data to uncover insights</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-2 md:gap-8">
            <div class="md:col-span-1">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Co-founder</h3>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground">Reskill School</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">2021 - 2023</p>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-2">
              <ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-2">
                <li>Designed comprehensive tech-learning programs for senior citizens and middlers</li>
                <li>Spearheaded the development of product from concept to MVP</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-2 md:gap-8">
            <div class="md:col-span-1">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Head Academics and Design</h3>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground">ICT360, MindBox</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">2013 - 2021</p>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-2">
              <ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-2">
                <li>Led development of K12 ICT curriculum reaching 200,000+ students</li>
                <li>Designed a data-driven skill development framework</li>
                <li>Led a team of instructional designers, engineers, desingers, educators, and social scientists</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-2 md:gap-8">
            <div class="md:col-span-1">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Guest Faculty (Digital Design)</h3>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground">DSK-Rubika Int'l School of Design</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">2012 - 2014</p>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-2">
              <ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-2">
                <li>Taught digital design and visualization to industrial design graduates</li>
                <li>Mentored and guided students on digital product design projects and portfolios</li>
                <li>Jury for final year product design projects</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-2 md:gap-8">
            <div class="md:col-span-1">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Co-founder</h3>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground">Chapter Sixteen</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">2010 - 2012</p>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-2">
              <ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-2">
                <li>
                  As head of studio, delivered design projects focused on branding, web, mobile, visualization, and
                  animation
                </li>
                <li>Designed brand identity and launched first website for Eruditus</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 bg-gray-200" />

      <div class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-6">Skills & Expertise</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Education</h3>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-2">
              <li>Curriculum Development</li>
              <li>Instructional Design</li>
              <li>Program Management</li>
              <li>Professional Development</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Design</h3>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-2">
              <li>UX Design</li>
              <li>Design Thinking</li>
              <li>User Research</li>
              <li>Prototyping</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3">Technology</h3>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-2">
              <li>Product Roadmaps</li>
              <li>Data Analysis</li>
              <li>Design Engineering</li>
              <li>Agile Development</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 bg-gray-200" />

      <div class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-6">Connect</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">
          I'm always interested in discussing new opportunities, sharing insights, or exploring potential
          collaborations. Feel free to reach out through any of these channels:
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a
            href="mailto:me@nehal.work"
            class="no-underline inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2.5 border border-border rounded-md hover:bg-accent transition-colors"
          >
            <svg class="mr-2 h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M4 6h16v12H4z" />
              <path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6" />
            </svg>
            me@nehal.work
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://peerlist.io/nehal"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="no-underline inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2.5 border border-border rounded-md hover:bg-accent transition-colors"
          >
            <svg
              width="24"
              height="24"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              fill="none"
              xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
              class="mr-2 h-5 w-5"
            >
              <path
                d="M8.87026 3H15.1297C18.187 3 20.7554 5.29881 21.093 8.33741L21.3037 10.2331C21.4342 11.4074 21.4342 12.5926 21.3037 13.7669L21.093 15.6626C20.7554 18.7012 18.187 21 15.1297 21H8.87026C5.81296 21 3.24458 18.7012 2.90695 15.6626L2.69632 13.7669C2.56584 12.5926 2.56584 11.4074 2.69632 10.2331L2.90695 8.33741C3.24458 5.29881 5.81296 3 8.87026 3Z"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              />
              <path
                d="M9 17L9 13M9 13L9 7L13 7C14.6569 7 16 8.34315 16 10V10C16 11.6569 14.6569 13 13 13L9 13Z"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              />
            </svg>
            Peerlist
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://linkedin.com/in/nehaljoshi"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="no-underline inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2.5 border border-border rounded-md hover:bg-accent transition-colors"
          >
            <svg class="mr-2 h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path
                d="M4.98 3.5C4.98 4.88 3.86 6 2.48 6S0 4.88 0 3.5 1.12 1 2.5 1 5 2.12 4.98 3.5zM0 8h5v16H0zM8 8h4.8v2.2h.1c.7-1.2 2.4-2.5 4.9-2.5 5.2 0 6.2 3.4 6.2 7.8V24h-5v-7.6c0-1.8 0-4.2-2.6-4.2s-3 2-3 4.1V24H8z"
              />
            </svg>
            LinkedIn
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://x.com/nehalmax"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="no-underline inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2.5 border border-border rounded-md hover:bg-accent transition-colors"
          >
            <svg class="mr-2 h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M18.244 2H21l-6.52 7.455L22.143 22h-6.01l-4.71-6.153L6.04 22H3.28l6.97-7.965L2 2h6.163l4.257 5.583zM17.28 20h1.53L7.333 3.895H5.69z" />
            </svg>
            X (Twitter)
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
